On number states, their action is explicit: $\begin{aligned}
Q\ket{n,1}
&=\sqrt{m(n+1)}\,\ket{n+1,0},
&
Q\ket{n,0}&=0,\\
\bar Q\ket{n,0}
&=\sqrt{mn}\,\ket{n-1,1},
&
\bar Q\ket{n,1}&=0.\end{aligned}$

